---
description: Twig templates and public bundle assets (not applicable to this package)
globs:
  - "templates/**/*.twig"
  - "src/**/Resources/views/**/*.twig"
  - "src/Resources/public/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

This package ships no Twig templates and no public assets, so the usual Twig and asset rules are N/A here.

Do not:
- add a Twig template, a form theme or a file under `src/Resources/public/` without first opening a spec for it
  (a UI belongs in the host or in a UI bundle that builds on the public services of this package)
- add Twig or asset dependencies to `composer.json`

If a template or asset is ever added, copy the Twig and public-assets rule from a sibling bundle (small,
backward-compatible changes, no edits to generated `src/Resources/public/build`) and update this file.
